{
  "id": "334",
  "document": "静躁独行.txt",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "334:p0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "$t1 == '334'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76030:76046"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76046:76048"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我的……”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76048:76056"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你失去了视觉，眼前只有蠕动的雪花点。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76056:76076"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我的……”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76076:76084"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你的四肢僵直，你感觉不到地面，你感觉不到任何东西。你陷入无尽的虚空。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76084:76120"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我的！”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76120:76127"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你的听觉被尖锐、永恒、越来越强的噪音充满，它渗入你的大脑，压倒了你的最后一丝存在。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76127:76170"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我的！”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76170:76177"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你的身体消失了。每种感官都消失了。但是，你仍能听到祂在呼唤。祂在你的灵魂中回响，在你存在的核心摇晃。祂将你摇得开裂，碎成亿万个微小的碎片。它们于是被卷走，成为雪花的一部分。你成为雪花的一部分。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76177:76275"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p10",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "什么也没留下。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76275:76284"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p11",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "什么也没有。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76284:76292"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p12",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "结局。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76292:76297"
    },
    {
      "id": "334:p13",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": " （理智值归零）\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:76297:76307"
    }
  ]
}
